Hence, following order :
i) In the event of arrest, in Crime No.538 of 2021 registered with Kurla Police Station,
for the offences punishable under Sections 420 and 272 of the Indian Penal Code and Sections 51,52 and 53 of Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006, the applicant be released on bail, on executing PR bond of Rs.15,000/-, with one or two sureties in the like amount;
ii) The applicant shall report to the Investigating Officer on 14 th, 21st ,26th and 29th October 2021 and thereafter as and when directed;
